---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { business } from '../data/business';
---

<Base
  title="Terms & Conditions"
  description="Read Instant Chefs service terms covering chef hiring plans, advance payment, trials, non-refundable fees after hiring and replacement support."
  cta={false}
>
  <PageHero
    label="Terms & conditions"
    title="Clear expectations. From the start."
    text="These published service details are based on the client’s onboarding information. Confirm your specific requirement and selected plan with the team before payment."
  />
  <section class="section">
    <article class="container legal-content">
      <h2>Our staffing services</h2>
      <p>
        Instant Chefs assists restaurants, cafés, cloud kitchens, bakeries,
        long-term catering businesses and households needing a full-time live-in
        home chef. Maid and gardener requirements can also be discussed.
        Candidate suitability and availability are confirmed by the team for
        each requirement.
      </p>
      <h2>Hiring process</h2>
      <p>
        Share the staff type, cuisine, experience and salary range. Instant
        Chefs shortlists suitable chefs and arranges direct interviews with
        approximately 2–3 candidates. You choose a chef for a one-day trial.
        Hire if satisfied, or request another suitable candidate for a trial.
        You can try up to five chefs before making your final staff choice.
      </p>
      <h2>Published hiring plans</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Six-month chef hiring plan: ₹7,000 one-time service fee.</li>
        <li>Twelve-month chef hiring plan: ₹10,000 one-time service fee.</li>
        <li>Six-month home cook hiring plan: ₹15,000 one-time service fee.</li>
        <li>
          Twelve-month home cook hiring plan: ₹20,000 one-time service fee.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        The listed figures are service fees. Discuss the candidate’s salary
        separately. Confirm any applicable taxes and the details of your
        selected plan before paying. Domestic staff fees and terms are confirmed
        separately; these published plans do not automatically cover maid or
        gardener hiring.
      </p>
      <h2>Advance payment</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>
          Payment is collected in advance, before the trial begins.
        </strong>{' '}
        Confirm the requirement, selected plan and payment arrangements directly
        with the team.
      </p>
      <h2>Non-refundable fees after hiring</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>
          Service fees are non-refundable after the candidate is hired.
        </strong>{' '}
        The supplied terms do not specify a refund policy for every situation
        before hiring. Ask the team for clarification before payment if that is
        relevant to your decision.
      </p>
      <h2>What the service fee covers</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Sourcing and shortlisting suitable chefs.</li>
        <li>Hiring coordination and up to five chef trials.</li>
        <li>Support throughout the hiring period.</li>
        <li>Free chef replacements within the selected plan duration.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Replacement support</h2>
      <p>
        If your chef is not working out, contact the team to discuss a suitable
        replacement. Free chef replacements apply within the duration of your
        selected hiring plan. Specific availability, coordination and joining
        arrangements are discussed with the team.
      </p>
      <h2>Your hiring decision</h2>
      <p>
        Direct interviews and a practical trial help you assess whether a
        candidate is suitable for your kitchen. Discuss duties, schedule,
        salary, food requirements and any live-in arrangements with the
        candidate and the team before final selection.
      </p>
      <h2>Website enquiries</h2>
      <p>
        The enquiry form prepares a message for your review. It does not book a
        candidate, make a payment or confirm a hire. Sending a WhatsApp message
        or email begins a conversation with the team.
      </p>
      <h2>Contact for clarification</h2>
      <p>
        For service questions or clarification of terms, call{' '}
        <a href={business.tel}>{business.phone}</a> or email{' '}
        <a href={`mailto:${business.email}`}>{business.email}</a>.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>
</Base>
